    "title": "Ukraine Reports Russian Drone Strike Causing Power Outage at Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant in Slavutych - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago CHERNOBYL — On October 1, Ukraine reported a Russian drone attack targeted an energy facility in Slavutych, leading to a blackout at the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant. The incident caused voltage surges that de-energized the New Safe Confinement structure, which isolates the destroyed fourth reactor unit and prevents radioactive material release. Approximately 20,000 residents in Slavutych were left without electricity. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
